!!! A record's stated purpose reaches the artifact.
!!!
!!! Under NIL-0093 an agent image states what its declarations are for, and
!!! that statement is derived from the artifact rather than taken on trust. So
!!! a 'context' written above a record has to survive compilation, emission and
!!! reloading -- not merely be accepted by the parser.
!!!
!!! This fixture runs the program; 'matrix.execution' also compares the emitted
!!! NIL against a hand-written Ny twin where one exists, which is what would
!!! catch the annotation reaching the schema under a different spelling.
book tour.record-context

context "A rectangle on screen, in device pixels."
public rectangle begin record
    field width  as number
    field height as number
end record

!!! A record with no annotation must still emit cleanly.
public point begin record
    field x as number
    field y as number
end record

main returns number begin paragraph
    value box is build rectangle with width being 8, height being 5
    value origin is build point with x being 0, y being 0
    say box.width times box.height
    say origin.x
    give 0
end paragraph
